猫かぶりの 猫かぶりの ちょっと臆病な君が好き
I like you, who are a bit cowardly, wearing a cat disguise, wearing a cat disguise.

113
00:17:00,324 --> 00:17:05,524
誰とも馴染めない世界で やっと見つけた居場所だから
Because this is the place I finally found in a world where I don't fit in with anyone.

114
00:17:06,024 --> 00:17:15,024
猫かぶりの 猫かぶりの 凡才を知ってる僕が好き 君も僕もとかしてる世界で 明日もまた会えたらいいな
I like myself, who knows my own mediocrity under a cat disguise... in a world where you and me melt together, I hope we can meet again tomorrow.

115
00:17:18,024 --> 00:17:22,524
猫かぶりの 猫かぶりの
Wearing a cat disguise, wearing a cat disguise...

116
00:17:26,824 --> 00:17:34,024
凡才を知ってる 君が好きだよ
I love that you know my mediocrity.

117
00:17:52,024 --> 00:17:54,024
[Title: ぺこらんだむぶれいん！]
[Title: Pekorandum Brain!]

