202
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:05,540
ここは宴 鋼の檻 その断頭台を飛び降りて
This is a banquet, a cage of steel, jump down from that guillotine

203
00:29:06,060 --> 00:29:12,840
千本桜 夜に紛れ 君が歌い 僕らは踊る
Senbonzakura, lost in the night, you sing and we dance

204
